        {
          "type": "modopedia:text",
          "x": 2,
          "y": 16,
          "width": 96,
          "line_height": 9,
          "text": "This manual follows the complete array pipeline: pixels become glyphs, glyphs become arrays, and arrays compile into executable operations. It is also a developer-facing index of"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "the system."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• Canvas data stores colors, mana effect layers, and compile caches.\n• The server extracts connected glyphs and recognizes them with templates."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• An outer circle organizes inner glyphs into a nestable syntax tree.\n• The compiler matches operation definitions and creates entity, element, and projection runtimes."
    },
